<title>PERU: Peru's Edelnor sets share dividend.</title>
<headline>Peru's Edelnor sets share dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's electricity distributor Edelnor has fixed an 8.86656872 percent share dividend, the Lima Stock Exchange's daily report said Monday.</p>
<p>The dividend corresponds to a 58.289 million sol capital increase to 715.685 million soles based on a &quot;reevaluation&quot; of the company, the report added.</p>
<p>It did not give a record or payout date.</p>
<p>-- Lima newsroom, 221-2134</p>
</text>
